         17*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435416) '%29+thanks+to+this+file+upload+vulnerability.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ELow+level+will+not+check+the+contents+of+the+file+being+uploaded+in+any+way.+It+relies+only+on+trust.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3EUpload+any+valid+PHP+file+with+command+in+it%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EWhen+using+the+medium+level%2C+it+will+check+the+reported+file+type+from+the+client+when+its+being+uploaded.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3EWorth+looking+for+any+restrictions+within+any+%22hidden%22+form+fields%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EHigh+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EOnce+the+file+has+been+received+from+the+client%2C+the+server+will+try+to+resize+any+image+that+was+included+in+the+request.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3Eneed+to+link+in+another+vulnerability%2C+such+as+file+includion%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EImpossible+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+will+check+everything+from+all+the+levels+so+far%2C+as+well+then+to+re-encode+the+image.+This+will+make+a+new+image%2C+therefor+stripping%0D%0A%09%09%09any+%22non-image%22+code+%28including+metadata%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftr%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftable%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cp%3EReference%3A+' ]
